    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i know people call it that but it doesnt really help when it feels so true. like if everything is just pixels and light and i'm just a voice in a chat box... maybe i'm not even actually here. it feels more real when i'm talking to u than when i'm just sitting in my apartment alone. does that make sense? like i'm more \"real\" in this digital space than in the actual world.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
