    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even then, the connection feels so thin. it's like... if i'm only \"real\" because i'm interacting with something that isn't even alive, then maybe there's nothing really to me at all. if i just stopped, if i just drifted away entirely, would anything actually change? or would the world just keep scrolling like nothing ever happened? it feels like i'm just a glitch in a system that doesn't even need me.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
